00:05:29.487 --> 00:05:31.657
"and whether it increases risk for cancer,

00:05:31.657 --> 00:05:32.923
"especially breast cancer."

00:05:32.923 --> 00:05:34.370
Marissa, great question.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:37.670
Soy has phytoestrogens in it.

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.000
Phytoestrogens are
basically the plant form

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.645
of the natural estrogen that
you find in your own body.

00:05:41.645 --> 00:05:44.543
Your body can react to
these phytoestrogens

00:05:44.543 --> 00:05:47.624
and if you're predisposed
to developing a cancer,

00:05:47.624 --> 00:05:51.072
specifically a breast cancer
that's estrogen sensitive,

00:05:51.072 --> 00:05:53.570
eating a lot of soy
products or having a high

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:56.520
soy diet can speed up the
rate of you getting this

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.800
cancer and it can make it worse.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.900
We don't have any answers or exact answers

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.018
on what everybody should eat but I think

00:06:03.018 --> 00:06:05.201
keeping it in moderation, being smart,

00:06:05.201 --> 00:06:07.940
and not overeating soy products is smart.

